<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Financial Federal started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Financial Federal started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Financial Federal Corp with a strong buy rating and a 12-month price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-7/16 to 21-7/8.</p>
